              <span id="alg1.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{type}_{l}=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>type</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{type}_{l}=</annotation></semantics></math> straight <span id="alg1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
